Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}Queen Morvane would raise her dead kingdom.\NAnd the living would pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}Through the forest, her bandits hunt for souls.\NSouls to feed the rite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}But four survivors follow their trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.30,0:00:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}An axe sworn to vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}A huntress who will not abandon her people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}A shield against the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}And a flame to burn the dead queen’s dream to ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}STEEL · BLOOD · VENGEANCE
